"| DvoQubitové Gate | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
